cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Puppet Master: Composable Agent Skills for iOS Simulator and Device Control"
message: "If you use these skills in your work, please cite this repository."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Yeaser
    given-names: Kazi Samin
    alias: ksypinro
repository-code: "https://github.com/ksypinro/puppet-master"
url: "https://github.com/ksypinro/puppet-master"
abstract: >-
  Four composable Agent Skills that give LLM coding agents an evidence-based
  closed loop over iOS applications: Simulator UI automation with verified
  postconditions, native view hierarchy capture with geometry and constraints,
  LLDB code-state root-cause analysis, and Instruments performance measurement
  with bounded, reproducible evidence. Conforms to the Agent Skills open
  specification and installs into Claude Code, Codex, Cline, and other
  compatible agent runtimes.
keywords:
  - agent-skills
  - ios
  - simulator
  - xcode
  - lldb
  - instruments
  - ui-automation
  - view-hierarchy
  - llm-agents
  - debugging
